55,3,1,talk,Rin,,I like the idea of a fixed price. The valley inn seems like a safe bet for my budget.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm voting for the valley. Ninety minutes by train is perfect.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Asuka,,The valley inn's all-in rate is the most equitable way to handle the group's expenses.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"I still hate the futons, but the island's cold water and the city's chaos are worse.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Toshio,,The valley provides the right amount of structure to keep us together without being trapped.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, can you handle the futons if it means we all know the price?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It's only for a week, Takumi.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Asuka,,It's the most logical choice for the budget and the schedule.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, I'll survive the futons. I'm in for the valley.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree. The valley is the best compromise.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for the Hot Spring Town!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Hot Spring Town for me too.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I vote for the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I'll go with the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Hot Spring Town it is.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
